      "class_": "CODE_READ",
      "observed": "GraphLifecycle starts GDS schedulers and compliance task but does not start nightly health scan; search found only run_nightly_health_scan definition, no caller."
    },
    {
      "id": "E09",
      "repository": "Quantum-L9/Cognitive.Engine.Graphs",
