      "observed": "Per-process asyncio.Queue keyed by tenant, bounded 10000; QueueFull silently drops a target and accepted handler returns count; no durable process restart guarantee."
    },
    {
      "id": "E21",
      "repository": "Quantum-L9/Enrichment.Inference.Engine",
